        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">66</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Now... the door to the ambassador's office may be always open, but that doesn't mean he's not a busy man, especially now. 

Please keep that in mind when going to his office. Thank you.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
